---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面没有找到" description="你访问的页面不存在。" noindex>
	<section class="not-found">
		<div class="container not-found-inner">
			<p class="eyebrow">404 · LOST NOTE</p>
			<div class="not-found-code" aria-hidden="true">404</div>
			<h1>这条路暂时没有记录</h1>
			<p>页面可能已经移动，或者链接写错了。你可以回到首页，继续浏览已有的内容。</p>
			<div class="not-found-actions">
				<a class="button" href="/">返回首页</a>
				<a class="button button--secondary" href="/blog/">浏览文章</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.not-found {
		display: grid;
		min-height: 68vh;
		place-items: center;
		padding-block: 70px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.not-found-inner {
		position: relative;
		max-width: 760px;
	}

	.not-found-code {
		position: absolute;
		z-index: -1;
		top: 24px;
		left: 50%;
		color: rgb(23 63 53 / 5%);
		font-family: var(--font-serif);
		font-size: clamp(120px, 30vw, 280px);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
	}

	.not-found h1 {
		margin-top: 18px;
		font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 64px);
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
	}

	.not-found p:not(.eyebrow) {
		max-width: 520px;
		margin: 22px auto 0;
		color: var(--muted);
		line-height: 1.9;
	}

	.not-found-actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}
</style>
